jacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_evals.py:1-10 and dense epic/WS commentary throughout` — Preserve eval discrimination coverage. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_explain.py:1-10, 303-310` — Preserve packaged-guide and link-resolution contracts. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_generation_scope.py:1-23` — Preserve unrelated-write tolerance during signing. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_retry.py:1-18` — Preserve exact resume and refusal semantics. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_reuse_replay.py:1-19 and dividers through 271` — Preserve stored PASS replay and recency behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_reuse_type.py:1-11 and large dividers` — Preserve type-sensitive invalidation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_reuse.py:1-19, 42-50, 157-166` — Preserve zero-call BLOCK reuse behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_rising_floor.py:1-9, 176-179` — Preserve rising-floor convergence behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_type_partition.py:1-13, 79-89` — Preserve single-source type partitioning. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_workflow_ops_seam.py:1-36` — Preserve subprocess registry and workflow seam guarantees. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review_xcheck.py:1-13` — Preserve contradiction and consistency drops. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_plan_review.py:throughout; strongest 48-77, 1142-1153, 1299-1308, 1458-1528` — Preserve each test's gate invariant. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py:1-27, 127-144, 259-267` — Preserve pre-gate change compatibility. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_project_default_provider.py:1-25, 123-152` — Preserve default-provider configuration contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_project_failure_disposition_contract.py:1-22` — Preserve failure-disposition criterion behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_prompt_model_module_seam.py:1-44` — Preserve module boundary and import surface. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_prompt_repo_root_seam.py:1-21` — Preserve shared repository-root resolution. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_provider_credentials_hermeticity.py:1-26, 38-43` — Preserve injected credential-directory isolation. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/test_plan_review_evals.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_explain.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_generation_scope.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_retry.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_reuse_replay.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_reuse_type.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_reuse.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_rising_floor.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_type_partition.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_workflow_ops_seam.py tests/unit/test_plan_review_xcheck.py tests/unit/test_plan_review.py tests/unit/test_predates_gate_guard_parity.py tests/unit/test_project_default_provider.py tests/unit/test_project_failure_disposition_contract.py tests/unit/test_prompt_model_module_seam.py tests/unit/test_prompt_repo_root_seam.py tes